      sure there isnt already an ingredient there- create temp ingredient (disabled
      so it doesnt look weird) and then set position and check if that overlaps with
      anything and if it doesnt instantiate otherwise choose another position\n","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"1e2bb0ad-6a88-46b0-aebb-e54ae3abecbf","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":868.0,"yMin":392.0,"xMax":1114.0,"yMax":537.0},"title":"thinking","body":"get
      boundaries of the spawn area collider to get the range of x and y values\nrandomly
      select a spot and if its within and not taken spawn there\nif its not within
      try again\nig its taken pick another spot","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"5f3152f7-54aa-4262-8a7a-5e81f95d0527","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":1039.0,"yMin":-662.0,"xMax":1209.0,"yMax":-575.0},"title":"Sticky
